        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass tube plant
Infrastructure of a tube glass plant.;
UUID: f38fb1ba-57e1-3961-a8c5-0f473c79b45f
Infrastructure of a tube glass plant with data for land use and area of buildings. No data for machinery. Annual capacity normalized to 100000t/a.
Location: Production plant in DE.  Building background data from CH.
Technology: Tube glass manufacturing.
Time period: Date of estimation.
Production volume: 63000 t/a tube glass.
Sampling: Questionnaire. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f38fb1ba-57e1-3961-a8c5-0f473c79b45f.xml</text>
